      "name": "window-light",
      "description": "The scene of the Aqua capture: the viewer, inactive, behind a key New Message window, from the viewer's top-left corner to the New Message window's bottom-right corner. Whole crop: the desktop picture in the two uncovered corners is a flat stand-in colour, every glyph is a stand-in drawing, the message is the demo's invented one and the text is set in the fallback font.",
